{% set resource = resources.items | find("slug", "rapid-investment-case-study") %}

{# HERO SECTION #}
<section class="bg-white pt-28 md:pt-36 pb-8 md:pb-12 px-4 md:px-6">
  <div class="max-w-screen-2xl mx-auto">
    <div class="mb-8">
      <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-orange-600 text-white text-xs font-medium tracking-wide mb-4">
        Case Study
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-[56px] font-medium text-warm-black tracking-[-0.03em] leading-[1.1] mb-5" data-reveal>
        {{ resource.title }}
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-warm-600 leading-relaxed tracking-[-0.01em] mb-4" data-reveal>
        {{ resource.subtitle }}
      </p>
      <p class="text-base font-medium text-warm-black mb-4" data-reveal>
        Rapid Investment used Zunkiree Labs' AI research systems to cut deal-analysis time by roughly 10x, without giving up due-diligence depth.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-4" data-reveal>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 rounded-full">AI Development</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-sm text-warm-500" data-reveal>
        <span><strong>Client:</strong> {{ resource.client }}</span>
        <span><strong>Industry:</strong> {{ resource.industry }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    {# Results Bar #}
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 py-8 border-y border-gray-200 mb-8" data-reveal>
      {% for result in resource.results %}
      <div class="text-center md:text-left">
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl font-medium text-zunkiree-600 mb-1">{{ result }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-16 items-start">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7" data-reveal>
        <div class="aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden bg-gray-100">
          {% if resource.coverImage %}
            <img src="{{ resource.coverImage }}" alt="{{ resource.title }}" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
          {% else %}
            <div class="w-full h-full bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-600 to-emerald-800 flex items-center justify-center">
              <span class="text-white/30 text-4xl font-bold">{{ resource.type }}</span>
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-5" data-reveal>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-warm-black tracking-wide mb-6">Related Resources</h3>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <a href="/resources/admizz-case-study/" class="block group">
            <p class="text-base text-zunkiree-600 group-hover:text-zunkiree-700 leading-snug mb-2">
              Case Study: Admizz Education
            </p>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center text-warm-black">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"></path>
              </svg>
            </span>
          </a>
          <hr class="border-warm-200">
          <a href="/resources/corecloud365-case-study/" class="block group">
            <p class="text-base text-zunkiree-600 group-hover:text-zunkiree-700 leading-snug mb-2">
              Case Study: Corecloud365
            </p>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center text-warm-black">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"></path>
              </svg>
            </span>
          </a>
          <hr class="border-warm-200">
          <a href="/services/ai-development/" class="block group">
            <p class="text-base text-zunkiree-600 group-hover:text-zunkiree-700 leading-snug mb-2">
              AI Development Services
            </p>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center text-warm-black">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"></path>
              </svg>
            </span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# CONTENT SECTION #}
<section class="relative bg-white px-4 md:px-6 py-12 md:py-16 lg:py-20">
  <div class="max-w-screen-2xl mx-auto">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-16">

      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <div class="mb-10" data-reveal>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-warm-black mb-4">About Rapid Investment</h2>
          <p class="text-warm-600 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed">
            <strong>Rapid Investment Group</strong> evaluates investment opportunities across multiple sectors, running due diligence on deal flow that moves fast and doesn't wait for slow research cycles. Their analysts need to synthesize financials, market data, and risk factors under real time pressure.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-10" data-reveal>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-warm-black mb-4">The challenge</h2>
          <p class="text-warm-600 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Manual due diligence meant analysts spent most of their time gathering and cross-referencing information rather than actually evaluating it. Time-sensitive opportunities were sometimes missed simply because the research couldn't be completed fast enough.
          </p>
          <div class="p-6 bg-red-50 border-l-4 border-red-500">
            <p class="text-warm-600">
              <strong>Key pain points:</strong>
            </p>
            <ul class="mt-2 space-y-2 text-warm-600">
              <li>• Due diligence on a single deal often took days</li>
              <li>• Analysts spent most of their time on data gathering, not analysis</li>
              <li>• Time-sensitive opportunities were occasionally missed</li>
              <li>• Research depth varied analyst to analyst</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-10" data-reveal>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-warm-black mb-4">The solution</h2>
          <p class="text-warm-600 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Rapid Investment deployed Zunkiree's AI systems to pull together financials, market data, and risk signals into a single structured research pass per opportunity. Analysts now start from a synthesized baseline instead of raw source documents.
          </p>
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="p-4 bg-gray-50">
              <p class="font-medium text-warm-black mb-1">Automated research synthesis</p>
              <p class="text-warm-600 text-sm">Financials, filings, and market signals are pulled together into one structured brief per opportunity.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 bg-gray-50">
              <p class="font-medium text-warm-black mb-1">Consistent due-diligence coverage</p>
              <p class="text-warm-600 text-sm">Every deal gets the same depth of research, regardless of which analyst is running it.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 bg-gray-50">
              <p class="font-medium text-warm-black mb-1">Faster time-to-decision</p>
              <p class="text-warm-600 text-sm">Analysts move from raw data to a decision-ready view in a fraction of the time.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-10" data-reveal>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-warm-black mb-4">The results</h2>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
            {% for result in resource.results %}
            <div class="p-6 bg-green-50 border-l-4 border-green-500 text-center">
              <p class="text-lg font-medium text-warm-black">{{ result }}</p>
            </div>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-warm-400 mt-4">
            Illustrative results based on a representative engagement; individual outcomes vary and are not guaranteed.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-10" data-reveal>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-warm-black mb-4">Why it mattered</h2>
          <p class="text-warm-600 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
            The bottleneck was never the analysts' judgment — it was how long it took them to get a clean, decision-ready view of a deal. A faster manual process would still have meant a person reading through filings line by line. Rapid Investment needed the synthesis itself to happen automatically, so the first thing an analyst sees is already a structured picture of the opportunity, not a stack of raw documents to work through before the real analysis can start.
          </p>
          <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-zunkiree-600 pl-4 text-warm-700 italic">
            "The model is the easy part. What actually mattered was getting the data pulled together before an analyst even opens the file."
            <span class="block not-italic text-sm text-warm-500 mt-2">— Head of Research, Rapid Investment</span>
          </blockquote>
        </div>

        {# Quote #}
        <div class="mb-10 p-8 bg-gray-50" data-reveal>
          <blockquote class="text-xl text-warm-black italic mb-4">
            "We used to lose good opportunities to the clock. Now our analysts start from a synthesized view of the deal instead of a stack of raw documents, and we move on time-sensitive deals we would have missed before."
          </blockquote>
          <p class="text-warm-600">
            <strong>Head of Research</strong><br>
            Rapid Investment
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-5" data-reveal>
        <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-24">
          {% set formTitle = resource.formTitle %}
          {% set ctaText = resource.ctaText %}
          {% include "components/lead-capture-form.njk" %}
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

